{"id":"bod","name":"BOD","form":"capsule","status":"Documented","aliases":"","category":"Psychedelic","summarySources":"TripSit","summary":"Beta-methoxy analogue of 2C-D, reports indicate it to be a more \"mild\" than the likes of 2C-x and DOx compounds. Reports on the bodyload are highly variable amongst users. Some experience an intense bodyload while others barely feel anything at all.","doseMaxTick":80,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[{"roa":"Oral","source":"TripSit","unit":"mg","threshold":"12–15 mg","light":"15–20 mg","common":"20–30 mg","strong":"30–30 mg","heavy":"30–40 mg+","commonEstimate":25,"band":{"low":20,"high":30},"domain":[9.6,66],"segments":{"light":[15,20],"common":[20,30],"strong":[30,30],"heavy":[30,63.36]}}],"durationSources":"TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"General","onset":"60–120 min","comeup":"—","peak":"—","offset":"—","afterEffects":"3–6 h","total":"8–14 h"}],"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"Euphoria"},{"name":"Empathy"},{"name":"Insight"},{"name":"Brightened colour"},{"name":"Closed/Open eye visuals"},{"name":"Enhanced tactile sensation"},{"name":"Mental/physical stimulation"},{"name":"Decreased appetite"},{"name":"Pupil dilation"},{"name":"Restlessness"},{"name":"Change in perception"},{"name":"Ego softening"},{"name":"Sweating/chills"},{"name":"Muscle tension"},{"name":"Confusion"},{"name":"Insomnia"}],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/bod"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_BOD.shtml"},{"title":"PiHKAL Entry","description":"Alexander & Ann Shulgin phenethylamine monograph","url":"https://www.erowid.org/library/books_online/pihkal/pihkal014.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BOD_(psychedelic)"},{"title":"Wikidata","descripti